 "operation": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.1 Initial Display",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Criteria: Order From = 1st day of previous month, Order To = system date (TBD, OQ-14); tab Regular Trip; list loaded automatically.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Access: VPLD (Planner) - approve; IELP Admin - view only (message no. 1); Supplier / Driver - no access (message no. 2). The backend checks the role again on every call.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.2 Search / Eligible Deliveries",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Delivery is listed when Daily status = 'Finish Daily Order' (finished by LP) and SA_NO is empty, and Order Date is within the criteria (SA-01). Delivery with an SA Number never appears again.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "For every row the system calculates route, Total KM, PO, rate and cost (5.3) and shows the validation result.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.3 Calculation",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5.3.1 Route",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Legs = finished cycles (Finish Cycle time set), From -> To; location name -> Master Location code. Order Route = first From + every To.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5.3.2 Total KM",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "KM of a leg = Master Mileage From -> To with status Active (directional). Total KM = sum, 2 decimals.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5.3.3 PO mapping",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Candidates: PO type TC-PBR, same trucking company code, validity period covers the Order Date. A PO of another month is never used unless its validity covers the date.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "None: PO Not Found. Only inactive (not Approved / Auto Approved): PO Not Active. More than one active: Multiple PO Found (no manual choice).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Rate = PO rate per KM (Mileage Cost IDR/Km from E-Catalogue at PR time). Never hard-coded.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5.3.4 Cost",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Delivery Cost = round(Total KM x PO Rate per KM) in PO currency. Rounding rule TBD (OQ-07). Fix Cost is not part of this screen (OQ-08).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5.3.5 Validation rules",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 2,
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "ID",
     "width": 6
    },
    {
     "title": "Label",
     "width": 14
    },
    {
     "title": "Condition",
     "width": 26
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "SA-V01",
     "Not Eligible",
     "Daily status is not Finish Daily Order"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V02",
     "Already SA Approved",
     "Delivery already has an SA Number"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V03",
     "Trucking Company Code Not Found",
     "No code for the trucking company"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V04",
     "Route Not Found",
     "No finished cycle, or a cycle location has no Master Location code"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V05",
     "Total KM Not Found",
     "A leg From -> To has no active Master Mileage"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V06",
     "Invalid Total KM",
     "Leg or Total KM <= 0"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V07",
     "PO Not Found",
     "No TC-PBR PO of the trucking company valid on the order date"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V08",
     "PO Not Active",
     "PO found but status not Approved / Auto Approved"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V09",
     "Multiple PO Found",
     "More than one active PO covers the order date"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V10",
     "Rate Not Found",
     "PO has no rate per KM"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V11",
     "Invalid Rate",
     "Rate <= 0"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V12",
     "Cost Calculation Failed",
     "Result not finite or <= 0"
    ],
    [
     "SA-V13",
     "Cost Changed",
     "Cost at Approve differs from the cost shown (Approve only)"
    ]
   ],
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "A row with any issue cannot be selected; all issues are shown.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.4 Calculation Detail",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Popup with delivery info, legs and KM, PO and cost formula, validation list. Read only.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.5 Approve - Confirmation",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Approve enabled for VPLD with >= 1 selected row. Confirmation (message no. 5) with summary per trucking company + PO.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.6 Approve - Server Processing (one transaction)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "1.",
   "text": "Check role VPLD (message no. 8) and request id: a request id already processed returns the stored result; still processing: message no. 11.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "2.",
   "text": "Lock the selected Daily orders and revalidate each (5.2, 5.3) incl. cost shown vs recalculated (SA-V13).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.",
   "text": "Any failure: rollback, nothing approved, message no. 7 with the list (all-or-nothing, OQ-09).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "4.",
   "text": "Group by trucking company + PO. Per group: next sequence (5.7), SA Number, insert SA header and details with calculation snapshot.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "5.",
   "text": "Update Daily order: status 'SA Approved', SA_NO, SA_DT, SA_BY; write Daily history 'SA Approval' and SA audit.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "6.",
   "text": "Commit; message no. 6; approved rows leave the list and appear in SA Monitoring. Any DB error: rollback, message no. 10.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.7 SA Number",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "ILS/TR/{Trucking Company Code}/{YYMMDD}{Sequence 4}, e.g. ILS/TR/DNX/2611040001. YYMMDD = approval (server) date.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Sequence scope configurable: per trucking company per date (default) or global per date (OQ-01). Starts at 0001 per date, max 9999.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Concurrency: sequence row locked and incremented inside the approval transaction; unique index on SA_NO; rollback returns the number.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.8 Post-approval",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "The approved amount is kept in the SA detail snapshot; later PO / master changes do not change it.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Daily Monitoring shows the SA Number; Order Detail no longer offers 'Proses ke SA'.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.9 Monthly Truck (Fixed Cost)",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Listed: monthly PO (PR type Fixed Cost) with status Approved / Auto Approved (released), without SA Number, production month overlapping Order From - To. Pending / Rejected PO are not listed.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 2,
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "ID",
     "width": 6
    },
    {
     "title": "Label",
     "width": 14
    },
    {
     "title": "Condition",
     "width": 26
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "SA-M01",
     "Monthly Cost Not Found",
     "PO without monthly cost"
    ],
    [
     "SA-M02",
     "Invalid Monthly Cost",
     "Monthly cost <= 0"
    ],
    [
     "SA-M03",
     "Trucking Company Code Not Found",
     "No code for the trucking company"
    ],
    [
     "SA-M04",
     "PO Not Active",
     "PO not released at Approve"
    ],
    [
     "SA-M05",
     "Already SA Approved",
     "PO already has an SA Number"
    ],
    [
     "SA-M06",
     "Monthly Cost Changed",
     "Amount at Approve differs from the one shown (Approve only)"
    ]
   ],
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Approve: same as 5.5 - 5.6 (VPLD, confirmation message no. 12, revalidation, all-or-nothing, request id, rollback). One SA per monthly PO; SA Number same format and sequence (5.7); header SA type MONTHLY with one detail (PO, PR, month, amount snapshot); the monthly PO gets the SA Number.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "The monthly SA appears in SA Monitoring with SA Type 'Monthly Truck' and follows the same PAS interface.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "5.10 Open Questions",
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 2,
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "ID",
     "width": 6
    },
    {
     "title": "Question",
     "width": 40
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "OQ-01",
     "SA sequence scope: per trucking company per date or global per date?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-02",
     "Definition of Inter Plant Trip vs Regular Trip."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-03",
     "Meaning / source of the Service column ('CE')."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-04",
     "Storage of PO type, validity, rate per KM, currency."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-05",
     "PO match on route when one LP has several TC-PBR POs in a month?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-06",
     "Location codes stored on orders / cycles?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-07",
     "Rounding rule of cost and Total KM."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-08",
     "Fix Cost (monthly price) in this screen or not?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-09",
     "All-or-nothing per request or partial per trucking company group?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-10",
     "SA statuses after approval, SA cancellation."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-11",
     "Relation to Proses ke PAS / SA Approved with PO Number."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-12",
     "Which VPLD roles / levels may approve? Amount limit?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-13",
     "'Finished by LP' = Finish Daily Order only, or all cycles Finish + container?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-14",
     "Default date range; max rows per approval request."
    ],
    [
     "OQ-16",
     "Monthly truck: SA allowed before / during / after the service month?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-17",
     "Monthly truck: full amount or deductions (truck not available, KPI, partial month)?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-18",
     "Monthly truck: one SA per PO, or per trucking company and month with the delivery SA? Different SA type code?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-19",
     "PR / PO sequence > 1 (additional Fixed Cost) as own row?"
    ]
   ],
   "row_lines": "all"
